{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Step 7: compare with the model answers\nFor each question, read your answer and the model answer, and say whether yours says the same.",
      "id": "class_s02_compare_0"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Dates in FEEL.**\n\n*Yours:* {{self1}}\n\n*Model:* FEEL adds durations to dates, not numbers to dates: today() + 5 gives null. string(...) stores the date as text (2026-11-25), which forms, Operate and the REST API read without converting it.",
      "id": "class_s02_compare_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "rateSelf1",
      "label": "Does yours say the same?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "Yes, it says the same",
          "value": "yes"
        },
        {
          "label": "Partly",
          "value": "partly"
        },
        {
          "label": "No, I missed it",
          "value": "no"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s02_compare_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Where a variable lives.**\n\n*Yours:* {{self2}}\n\n*Model:* In the process instance, at process level (unless a mapping says otherwise). In Operate, open the instance: the Variables panel shows it and lets you edit it while the instance runs; the next form or expression reads the new value.",
      "id": "class_s02_compare_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "rateSelf2",
      "label": "Does yours say the same?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "Yes, it says the same",
          "value": "yes"
        },
        {
          "label": "Partly",
          "value": "partly"
        },
        {
          "label": "No, I missed it",
          "value": "no"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s02_compare_4"
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "class-s02-compare",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.9.0",
  "schemaVersion": 18
